# body

Intended path docs/x.md -> md mode. A structured `publisher:` source-citation
field with NO reviewed-allow marker. The gate still fires (publisher CalGEM is
not the PRINCIPAL and nothing whitelists it) -> BLOCK. Proves the allow path is
opt-in: without a marker, a non-principal source-citation field still blocks.
